-- Dependent array length (pinning)
--
-- The length of `Int<n>` is an expression, so a bound parameter may size an
-- array type.  The check pins `n` to the literal's length, 3 — the
-- parameter is monomorphized, and applying any other length fails at the
-- apply (`expected 3, found …`).
-- output: [1, 2, 3]

((n => ([1, 2, 3] : Int<n>)) 3) : Int<3>
